<title>USA: Granite Broadcasting Q1 shr loss $1.09.</title>
<headline>Granite Broadcasting Q1 shr loss $1.09.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>GRANITE BROADCASTING CORP.</p>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data and number of shares)</p>
